  "body": "## What changed\n- Updated `emit_pocket_passes` in `crates/motion/src/machining2d/pocket_emit.rs` to hold `post_crossing_free` whenever `hold_crossings` is set or the strategy fits pass arcs (`Adaptive`, `OffsetRings`, or `Waterline`).\n- Counted fitted arcs into `proof.arcs` in the `fit_arcs` branch so `ProofTally::note()` reports accurate totals when a crossing arc returns to chords.\n- Added unit pin `offset_rings_across_one_micron_vertex_step_post_crossing_free` and integration suite `crates/app/tests/adaptive_fig8_crossing.rs`.\n- Recorded the design decision in `docs/decisions/2240-adaptive-fig8-crossing.md`.\n\n## Cause\n- On `fig8.step` (tight stock or stock excluding the top face), 2D Adaptive refuses the HSM planner and falls back to `PocketStrategy::OffsetRings`.\n- Clipper2 integer quantization (`1e-6 mm` grid) on STEP-faceted circles creates micron-scale vertex steps that split `fit_arcs` across `sag_bound` into `[Arc, 1 um Line, Arc]`.\n- Because `ARC_FIT_TOL` (`0.01 mm`) exceeds the `1 um` line, adjacent arc chord brackets cross in XY at shared depth and block posting.\n- `emit_pocket_passes` previously checked `post_crossing_free` only for `Adaptive` and `hold_crossings` (`rest2d`), leaving `OffsetRings` and `Waterline` pockets unguarded.\n\n## Tests\n- Pin `offset_rings_across_one_micron_vertex_step_post_crossing_free` (`camcraft-motion`): failed on unguarded `upstream/main` logic (`[[5, 7], [15, 17]]`), passed after restoring the fix.\n- Pins `adaptive2d_on_fig8_model_in_tight_stock_has_no_crossings_and_posts` and `adaptive2d_on_fig8_stock_excluding_top_face_has_no_crossings_and_posts` (`camcraft-app --test adaptive_fig8_crossing`): failed on unguarded `upstream/main` logic (`[[69, 71], [197, 199], [1003, 1005], [1131, 1133]]` and `[[69, 71], [197, 199], [1338, 1340], [1466, 1468]]`), passed after restoring the fix (`0` crossings, `0` warnings, clean simulation and post).\n- Mutation check: reverted `hold_fitted` and `proof.arcs` in `pocket_emit.rs` to `upstream/main`, confirmed both pin targets failed (`0` passed), restored the fix, and confirmed both passed.\n- Extra `camcraft-motion` integration suites (`adaptive_hsm`, `adaptive_orbit_seam`, `corner_blend_arc`, `machining2d`, `optimal_load`, `rest2d`): passed (`0` failed; `5` ignored heavy tests in `adaptive_hsm`).\n- Gate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed (`wall 11.6 min, 2 step(s), 0 failed`).\n- Clippy: `cargo clippy -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed; `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --lib --test adaptive_fig8_crossing -- -D warnings` passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n- None (`git diff --stat upstream/main -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` is empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets -- -D warnings` failed to compile untouched pre-existing `crates/app/tests/wire_tool.rs` on branch base `e3f7d122b` (fixed later on `upstream/main` in `#2263`).\n- Full `gate batch` and `gate release` suites did not run in this worker; only `gate quick` and the six listed `camcraft-motion` 2D suites ran.\n\n## Overlaps\n- None among open PRs (`pocket_emit.rs` and `adaptive_fig8_crossing.rs` have no open PR overlaps).\n\nChangelog: Fix 2D Adaptive feed crossings on fig8 by enforcing the crossing law on OffsetRings and Waterline passes.\n\nFixes #2240\n\n## Latest review fix: release heavy lane\n\nBoth fig8 tests now have ignore reasons that name the release heavy lane:\n\n- `adaptive2d_on_fig8_model_in_tight_stock_has_no_crossings_and_posts`\n- `adaptive2d_on_fig8_stock_excluding_top_face_has_no_crossings_and_posts`\n\nBoth tests keep their crossing, verification, and post assertions. The fast motion regression stays active.\n\n- Release run: `cargo test --release -p camcraft-app --test adaptive_fig8_crossing -- --ignored --test-threads=1`: 2 passed, 0 failed in 36.74 seconds (190.51 seconds with the build).\n- Lane mutation check: Removing both ignore attributes made the ignored-inventory check fail with 0 tests. Restoring them passed with 2 tests. The default debug run reported 0 passed and 2 ignored.\n- Fast motion regression: `offset_rings_across_one_micron_vertex_step_post_crossing_free` passed (1 passed, 0 ignored).\n- Quick gate: `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`: RED after 6.7 minutes. The batch debug build failed at unchanged `crates/app/tests/wire_tool.rs:106–107`. Error E0308 requires `Option` for `material`. Error E0063 reports missing `stepdown` and `stepover` fields.\n- Clippy, all targets with warnings denied: `camcraft-cl` and `camcraft-motion` passed for all targets with warnings denied. The app library and `adaptive_fig8_crossing` target also passed with warnings denied. The app all-targets check failed at the unchanged `wire_tool.rs` fixture with the same gate errors.\n- New head: `4135da36b5ba6c95b5907c8491962e7935768a1c`.\n",
